Zebra
*****

   Zebra is a multi-server routing software which provides TCP/IP based
routing protocols such as RIP, OSPF, BGP and so on.  Zebra turns your
machine into a full powered router.

   This is Zebra Manual for snapshot zebra-19990319.

   This manual describes `zebra' and some other beasts.

